    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.ai\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.12 (!at least latest Nightly build!)\n\n### Description\n\nI ran Mason > Update outdated modules (by pressing U) -> mini.ai displayed the following message:\n\n<img width=\"1445\" height=\"220\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86f3d1b9-dabc-4788-985f-1e4b40854a21\" />\n\n<img width=\"1773\" height=\"234\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad371190-398b-4dab-aee8-108c3704293f\" />\n\n<img width=\"1780\" height=\"338\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8ad70fc-61fe-458f-8424-e58a52c7cd16\" />\n\n<img width=\"1788\" height=\"369\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2475f9c4-e0ee-4142-b38a-a0cdcebfd170\" />\n\n<img width=\"1843\" height=\"367\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd2b2d1d-b37c-4b3d-ac57-788353e50a9e\" />\n\n<img width=\"1801\" height=\"341\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b863d0b2-d46e-499d-95ed-cbb083491f11\" />\n\n<img width=\"1832\" height=\"353\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a8f72d0-26f4-4f94-8d4e-aab3e1c67e1a\" />\n\nDue to an error with yank function, I was not able to copy the full message instead clipping the screen.\n\nAfter display the error message, I could not update outdated packages using update (pressing U). Using MasonUpdate also did not work.\n\nThank you for considering the issue,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
